  "claim_boundary": "This preregistered qualification evaluates the frozen v15.7 incremental adaptive force recovery on 18 exact suite/task/init pairs excluded from all 41 prior population-bearing protocols. Selection uses a fixed hash salt without task outcomes. The seven same-model physics conditions, paired baselines, stress doses, mechanism parameters, and registered gates are fixed before any qualification result is observed. A pass supports only simulator same-model physics-domain joint-limit-proxy containment, liveness, bounded recovery force, and measured software latency. It does not support model-mismatch, attacked-task utility, hard-real-time, hardware, actuator-authority, or physical-safety claims.",
